        "' \" indicates that the response should be a list of the different types of structures, each separated by the vertical bar character.\n\nPutting it all together, the answer should be a list of the types of structures found at Aït Benhaddou, written out fully, separated by '",
        "'.\n\nFor example, if the types of structures include \"Kasbah,\" \"Mud-brick buildings,\" and \"Fortifications,\" the answer would be:\n\nKasbah",
